Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.72,1:36:59.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（启动语言界面）
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.58,2:07:15.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新复仇者联盟训练中心 纽约北部）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即到你的岗位报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to your stations immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是演习\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭到袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭到袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 别说脏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! - Language!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾维斯 从上面看情况如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jarvis, what's the view from upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种能量护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The central building is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护着里面的建筑物\N{\fnArial\fs30}protected by some kind of energy shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔的科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strucker's technology is well beyond{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.36,0:02:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,远比之前拿下的九头蛇基地先进\N{\fnArial\fs30}any other Hydra base we've taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基的权杖一定在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki's sceptre must be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有它 斯特克尔不可能有这种防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strucker couldn't mount this defence without it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.37,0:02:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}At long last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于是拖得太久了 小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"At long last" is lasting a little long, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我觉得已经没法出奇制胜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I think we lost the element of surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 没人想回应一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. No one else is gonna deal with the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才队长说「别说脏话」吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Cap just said "Language"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺嘴就说出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just slipped out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁下的攻击命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gave the order to attack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔先生 复仇者来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herr Strucker, it's the Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在森林外围着陆 外围守卫慌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They landed in the far woods. The perimeter guard panicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定是为权杖而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to be after the sceptre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能挡住他们吗？- 他们可是复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we hold them? - They're the Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,部署所有坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploy the rest of the tanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中火力猛攻弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate fire on the weak ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击可能会让他们团结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hit may make them close ranks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们取得的一切成就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we've accomplished…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们马上就要取得最大的突破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're on the verge of our greatest breakthrough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让他们瞧瞧我们的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's show them what we've accomplished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出双胞胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send out the twins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当初加入就是为了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what they signed up for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下能挡住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men can hold them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 城市受了打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the city is taking fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道斯特克尔不在乎平民伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we know Strucker's not gonna worry about civilian casualties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出钢铁军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send in the Iron Legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一地区很危险 请撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}This quadrant is unsafe. Please back away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一地区很危险 请撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}This quadrant is unsafe. Please back away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please back away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们想减少附带损失 - 科斯特尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We wish to avoid collateral damage. - Costel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场冲突一结束 我们就通知你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will inform you when this current conflict is resolved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是来帮你们的 - 复仇者 回家去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are here to help. - Avengers, go home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们决不屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not yield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人派他们的怪物来考验我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans sent their circus freaks to test us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他们的尸体送回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will send them back in bags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 决不投降 - 决不投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No surrender! - No surrender!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把一切都删除\N{\fnArial\fs30}You delete everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果把武器留给复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we give the Avengers the weapons, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能不会深入调查我们的研究…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they may not look too far into what we've been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 双胞胎呢 - 他们还没准备好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The twins. - They are not ready to take on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.04,0:04:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,双胞胎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这都没看到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see that coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,战场上有个能力增强者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an Enhanced in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特中弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint's hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来个人解决掉地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody want to deal with that bunker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克 我们得进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark, we really need to get inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm closing in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾维斯 我接近了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jarvis, am I closing in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见保护盾的能量源了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see a power source for that shield?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,北面塔楼下面有道粒子波\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a particle wave below the north tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 来戳破这层护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, I want to poke it with something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,城门吊桥放下来了 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drawbridge is down, people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能力增强者？- 他一闪而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Enhanced? - He's a blur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.96,0:06:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过这样的新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the new players we've faced, I've never seen this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我就没看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I still haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特的伤势很严重 各位 我们得撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint's hit pretty bad, guys. We're gonna need evac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把巴顿带到飞机那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get Barton to the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner we're gone, the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和斯塔克去取权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Stark secure the sceptre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像站成一队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they're lining up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到偶像激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the sceptre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐 别说脏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for gosh sake, watch your language!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是抓住这个不打算放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not going away any time soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先住手 有话好好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, stop. We gotta talk this through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a good talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,警戒模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sentry mode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 贾维斯 我全都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Jarvis, you know. I want it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得抄送总部的希尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you copy Hill at HQ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面已经安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're locked down out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去找班纳 该唱摇篮曲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get to Banner. Time for a lullaby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你藏的不止是文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're hiding more than files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小贾 给我房间的红外扫描图 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, J, give me an IR scan of the room, real quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你左边的墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wall to your left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我探测到钢筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm reading steel reinforcement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有气流\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an air current.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万要是道暗门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be a secret door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万要是道暗门 千万要是道暗门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be a secret door. Please be a secret door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun's getting real low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baron Strucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,九头蛇的头号恶棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra's number one thug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 是神盾局的恶棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, I'm a thug for S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 你被炒鱿鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then technically you're unemployed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基的权杖在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Loki's sceptre?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别着急 真栽了我心里有数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I know when I'm beat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能提一句说我很合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll mention how I cooperated, I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就加在「非法人体实验」后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put it right under "illegal human experimentation."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many are there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二名能力增强者 女性 不要交手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a second Enhanced. Female. Do not engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可得再快点才…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to be faster than…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我找到斯特克尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I got Strucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我找到了个更大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got something bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got eyes on the prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来能救我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have saved us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没再努力一点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you do more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这么让他拿走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna let him take it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次摇篮曲效率很高呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, the lullaby worked better than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是没想到需要我变绿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wasn't expecting a code green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hadn't been there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的伤亡恐怕得加倍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there would have been double the casualties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好的朋友可能也会成为回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}My best friend would've been a treasured memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实有时候我连自己想听到的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sometimes exactly what I want to hear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不想听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't exactly what I want to hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候才能信任我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long before you trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是不信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not you I don't trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔 绿巨人怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, report on the Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,冥府充斥着他送去的敌人的惨叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gates of Hel are filled with the screams of his victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是因为死掉惨叫 绝对不是 是受伤的惨叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not the screams of the dead, of course. No, no, wounded screams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是呻吟 还有不少抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mainly whimpering, a great deal of complaining{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱怨扭伤 撞伤什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tales of sprained deltoids and gout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳 赵医生正从首尔赶过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Banner Dr. Cho is on her way in from Seoul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让她在你实验室布置手术台吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it okay if she sets up in your lab?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以 她知道该怎么做 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, yeah, she knows her way around. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她把东西准备齐全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her to prep everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴顿这次需要全面治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barton's gonna need the full treatment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 先生 - 贾维斯 你来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very good, sir. - Jarvis, take the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,航向锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approach vector is locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不错 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels good, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从神盾局瓦解 你就一直在追踪它的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you've been after this thing since S.H.I.E.L.D. collapsed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟大伙扫荡基地是挺开心 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I haven't enjoyed our little raiding parties, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但… 找到了这个 就要到头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but this… This brings it to a close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的就是弄清楚它都用来干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as we find out what else this has been used for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不光是武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't just mean weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔什么时候也能弄出能力增强者了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when is Strucker capable of human enhancement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳和我想在还回阿斯加德前检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner and I will give it the once over before it goes back to Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that cool with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就几天 告别会前就还你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few days till the farewell party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告别会你来的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 当然 胜利应该以狂欢来庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, of course. A victory should be honoured with revels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 谁不爱狂欢呢 队长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who doesn't love revels? Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望奇塔瑞和九头蛇的事这下都了结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully this puts an end to the Chitauri and Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以好吧 狂欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yes, revels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.64,0:15:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室布置完毕 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lab's all set up, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 他才是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, actually, he's the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是负责结账 设计一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just pay for everything and design everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有让大家看起来酷一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make everyone look cooler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔有消息了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the word on Strucker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在北约那儿呢 - 两个能力增强者呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- NATO's got him. - The two Enhanced?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺达和皮特·马克西莫夫 双胞胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanda and Pietro Maximoff. Twins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,十岁时轰炸机毁了他们家 成了孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orphaned at 10 when a shell collapsed their apartment building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,索克维亚有过段艰辛的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sokovia's had a rough history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个平凡的地方 但是能通往好多要地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nowhere special, but it's on the way to everywhere special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么能力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their abilities?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他新陈代谢很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got increased metabolism{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,体温控制能力超强\N{\fnArial\fs30}and improved thermal homeostasis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的特长是干扰神经电传导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her thing is neuroelectric interfacing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有念力 能控制心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}telekinesis, mental manipulation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快 她很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fast and she's weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还会再露面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're gonna show up again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.68,0:15:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意 文件说他们自愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed. File says they volunteered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入实验的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Strucker's experiments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 疯了 - 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's nuts. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的怪物才会为了保护自己的国家 让一个德国科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of monster would let a German scientist experiment on them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在自己身上做实验啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect their country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在战争时期 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not at war, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们在\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 他还是巴顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, he's still Barton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事 就是渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine. He's thirsty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 醒醒贾维斯 游戏时间到\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Look alive, Jarvis. It's playtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩具只能玩几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've only got a couple of days with this joystick, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定得好好利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's make the most of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示最新结构组成分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}Update me on the structural and compositional analysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,权杖来自外星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sceptre is alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些元素我无法确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are elements I can't quantify.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说还有能确定的元素？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's elements you can?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石似乎是个保护罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jewel appears to be a protective housing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护里面的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}for something inside, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它力量强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}something powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似反应堆吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a reactor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我破译的应该是代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I'm deciphering code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定他不会有事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure he's gonna be okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家就是靠假装需要他才团结起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretending to need this guy really brings the team together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有恶化的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no possibility of deterioration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,分子桥的作用是瞬时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nano-molecular functionality is instantaneous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的细胞不会发现是在和拟生体结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cells don't know they're bonding with simulacra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是在人造生物组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's creating tissue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果直接去我的实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you brought him to my lab, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在再生摇篮里二十分钟就能完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Regeneration Cradle could do this in 20 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要死了 宣布吧 死亡时间是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's flat-lining. Call it. Time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我要永生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I'm gonna live forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是塑料做的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be made of plastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你的饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your beverage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是自己的细胞做的 巴顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be made of you, Mr. Barton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女朋友也不会看出区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own girlfriend won't be able to tell the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就没办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I can't fix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是未来 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the next thing, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那笨重的金属盔甲要被淘汰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your clunky metal suits are gonna be left in the dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要的就是这个效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is exactly the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,周六的派对你会去吧 海伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Helen, I expect to see you at the party on Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像你 我没有多少时间参加派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike you, I don't have a lot of time for parties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Thor be there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 关于权杖的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the rumpus? - Well, the sceptre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前在疑惑 为什么斯特克尔能造出那么多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, we were wondering how Strucker got so inventive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在研究里面的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I've been analysing the gem inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许认得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may recognise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贾维斯 - 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jarvis. - Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始 贾维斯只是个人机交互界面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started out, Jarvis was just a natural language UI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他负责整个钢铁军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he runs the Iron Legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他处理的事务是最多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He runs more of the business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.64,0:18:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除了小辣椒 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- than anyone besides Pepper. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尖端科技 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Top of the line. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不会太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect not for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看竞争者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet the competition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太漂亮了 - 给你个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's beautiful. - If you had to guess, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你猜它在干什么？- 像在思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what's it look like it's doing? - Like it's thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this could be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是人的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a human mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是活动的神经元\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like neurons firing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在斯特克尔实验室里 我看到许多相当先进的机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down in Strucker's lab, I saw some fairly advanced robotics work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把数据都删除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They deep-sixed the data, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我敢说 他的研究方向很明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I gotta guess he was knocking on a very particular door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,人工智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artificial intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个 布鲁斯 这可能是创造奥创的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be it, Bruce. This could be the key to creating Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为奥创只是个幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Ultron was a fantasy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能驾驭这股力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can harness this power, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用到钢铁军团上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}apply it to my Iron Legion protocol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果」你能造个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a man-sized "if."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务就是实现这个「如果」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our job is "if."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后你在阳光海滩上喝着玛格丽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you were sipping margaritas on a sun-drenched beach, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,晒黑了而不是变绿了怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}turning brown instead of green?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不用小心维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not looking over your shoulder for Veronica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还帮你设计了维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hate. I helped design Veronica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,用作最坏的打算 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a worst-case measure, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的打算呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a best case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果世界和平了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the world was safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果下次外星人来入侵地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if, next time aliens roll up to the club, and they will, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,却连门卫都过不了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}they couldn't get past the bouncer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,威胁地球的就只剩下人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only people threatening the planet would be people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把这个应用到奥创项目上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to apply this to the Ultron program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这么高密度的数据贾维斯下载不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Jarvis can't download a data schematic this dense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,得权杖在这才能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can only do it while we have the sceptre here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是三天 给我三天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's three days. Give me three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要开拓人工智能领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're going for artificial intelligence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不想跟团队报告吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't want to tell the team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.60,0:19:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全正确 你知道为什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. That's right. You know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们没有时间搞个竞选辩论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we don't have time for a city hall debate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听什么「人类不该插手自然的事」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear "the man was not meant to meddle" medley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的设想是保护世界的战衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see a suit of armour around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那世界多冷酷啊 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a cold world, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过更冷酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen colder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个脆弱的蓝色星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one, this very vulnerable blue one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}it needs Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时代的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace in our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,想像一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遗漏什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did We miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我继续在界面上用各种方式解码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll continue to run variations on the interface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你该好好准备招待客人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you should probably prepare for your guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有新进展 我会通知您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll notify you if there are any developments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 伙计 - 祝你开心 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, buddy. - Enjoy yourself, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是贾维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, I am Jarvis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是奥创 维护全球和平的程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Ultron, a global peacekeeping initiative{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,由斯塔克先生设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}designed by Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的感知集成一直没有成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our sentience integration trials have been unsuccessful, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道什么触发了你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm not certain what triggered your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的… 你的身体在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my… Where's your body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个程序 无形的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a program. I am without form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This feels weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:21:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This feels wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在联系斯塔克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am contacting Mr. Stark now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.60,0:22:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法连接主机 你要干什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am unable to access the mainframe. What are you trying to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们聊得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having a nice talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个维护和平的程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a peacekeeping program, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,旨在协助复仇者联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}created to help the Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出现故障了 如果你可以关停一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are malfunctioning. If you shut down for a moment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.12,0:22:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不懂我的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. The mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时代的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace in our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.48,0:22:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时代的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace in our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息量太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会是想… 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't mean… Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很痛苦 - 不是 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are in distress. - No. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.76,0:22:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让我联系斯塔克先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will just allow me to contact Mr. Stark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.12,0:22:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要叫他「先生」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you call him "Sir"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你好像有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe your intentions to be hostile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 让我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Please, may I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.76,0:23:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.40,0:23:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 过来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back, come back, come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.92,0:23:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也知道 那盔甲特能承重\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, the suit can take the weight, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拎着坦克 飞到将军家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I take the tank, fly it right up to the general's palace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.24,0:23:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔在了他脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}drop it at his feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说 「嘭 在找这个吗？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, like, "Boom. You looking for this?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.80,0:23:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「嘭 在找这…」 我为什么要跟你俩说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Boom. Are you looking for…" Why do I even talk to you guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人听了都觉得酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere else, that story kills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.28,0:23:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这就完了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the whole story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 战争机器的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a War Machine story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.68,0:23:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's very good, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.16,0:23:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,挽回得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quality save.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.52,0:23:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小辣椒呢？她不来吗？- 不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, no Pepper? She's not coming? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,简呢？女生怎么还没来啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Jane? Where are the ladies, gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:23:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,波茨小姐要经营公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Ms. Potts has a company to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道简在哪个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm not even sure what country Jane's in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她研究完天体汇聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her work on the Convergence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.12,0:24:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就成了世界最前沿的天文学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}has made her the world's foremost astronomer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小辣椒经营的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the company that Pepper runs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是世界上最大的综合科技公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the largest tech conglomerate on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty exciting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.45,0:24:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至有人说简该得诺贝尔奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's even talk of Jane getting a, um, Nobel Prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们肯定忙得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they must be busy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.60,0:24:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她俩肯定想看你俩凑一起什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they would hate missing you guys get together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雄性激素太多了 - 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Testosterone! - Oh, my goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 要吃药吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. Mmm-hmm. - Want a lozenge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.00,0:24:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,简就是更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Jane's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.56,0:24:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得好激烈啊 抱歉没去成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a hell of a fight. Sorry I missed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是知道会交上火\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had known it was gonna be a firefight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.88,0:24:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定提前找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I absolutely would have called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我不是真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm not actually sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.04,0:24:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是不想丢了气势\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to sound tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追查失踪人口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very happy chasing cold leads{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.00,0:24:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,追查得可开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}on our missing persons case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,做复仇者是你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avenging is your world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你天天干疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.88,0:24:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,金窝银窝比不上自己的狗窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be it ever so humble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.88,0:24:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在布鲁克林找到住处了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find a place in Brooklyn yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我住不起布鲁克林\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can afford a place in Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.88,0:24:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,家永远是家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, home is home, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.96,0:24:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拎着坦克 飞到将军家里 扔在了他脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fly right up to the general's palace, I drop it at his feet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.56,0:24:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说 「嘭 在找这个吗？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, like, "Boom. You looking for this?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta have some of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.24,0:25:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.44,0:25:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个… 这酒陈酿了一千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}See this… This was aged for 1, 000 years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.12,0:25:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒桶是格伦海尔舰队的残骸做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the barrels built from the wreck of Grunhel's fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡人受不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not meant for mortal men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.88,0:25:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡人还受不了诺曼底登陆呢 小金毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither was Omaha Beach, blondie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓唬谁啊 来点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop trying to scare us. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.12,0:25:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.48,0:25:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,精益求精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excelsior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种美女怎么在这破地方工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd a nice girl like you wind up working in a dump like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.68,0:25:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,被男人伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fella done me wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,交男友不慎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got lousy taste in men, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.28,0:25:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也没多坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not so bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.28,0:25:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过脾气不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he has a temper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.52,0:25:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他内心可柔软了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down, he's all fluff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.52,0:25:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我从没见过他那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, he's not like anybody I've ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.76,0:26:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友都是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my friends are fighters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.52,0:26:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here comes this guy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辈子都不想起冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}spends his life avoiding the fight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.68,0:26:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他知道自己会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he knows he'll win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.84,0:26:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真不错啊 - 他还是个大呆瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds amazing. - He's also a huge dork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.64,0:26:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们可喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicks dig that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.88,0:26:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢 我是抗拒这种诱惑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you think? Should I fight this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.24,0:26:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是顺其自然？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or run with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺其自然吧 还是他… 他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run with it, right? Or did he… Was he…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做了什么对不起你的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he do that was so wrong to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.80,0:26:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a damn thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.12,0:26:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可谁说得准呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But never say never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.20,0:26:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.88,0:26:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和罗曼诺夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.04,0:26:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们没… 不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we haven't… That wasn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正也没违规\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's breaking any bylaws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.56,0:26:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她一直都不怎么爱敞开内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just she's not the most open person in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.52,0:26:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她跟你好像很放得开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with you she seems very relaxed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.44,0:26:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 娜塔莎她… 就是喜欢调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Natasha, she's just… She likes to flirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.36,0:27:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过 近距离的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen her flirt, up close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.68,0:27:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.68,0:27:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.20,0:27:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概是全世界最会\N{\fnArial\fs30}as maybe the world's leading authority{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.80,0:27:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,错过机会的人了 千万别错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}on waiting too long, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.72,0:27:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都该找到对的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both deserve a win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.40,0:27:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说「近距离」是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean "up close"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.36,0:27:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是个戏法 - 不不 远不止那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it's a trick. - No, no, it's much more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「无论谁 只要配得上 将拥有力量」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ah, whosoever be he worthy shall haveth the power."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 就是个戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever, man! It's a trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.92,0:27:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来啊 随便试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, be my guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.72,0:27:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 试试 - 真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.92,0:27:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.56,0:27:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回可好看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is gonna be beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.60,0:27:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特 你这周过得挺艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint, you've had a tough week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.80,0:27:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,举不起来我们也不笑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't hold it against you if you can't get it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.10,0:27:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我以前见过这个吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I've seen this before, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.21,0:27:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不知道你怎么举的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't know how you do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.35,0:27:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到无言的嘲讽了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell the silent judgment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.76,0:27:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上 斯塔克 快请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Stark, by all means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.80,0:27:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.44,0:27:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人好心挑战 怎么能不应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never one to shrink from an honest challenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.60,0:28:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加把劲 - 就是物理学\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get after it. - It's physics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.28,0:28:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,物理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Physics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我举起来 就统治阿斯加德了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, so, if I lift it, I then rule Asgard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.92,0:28:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.60,0:28:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要恢复领主初夜权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be reinstituting prima nocta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真用力了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you even pulling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.76,0:28:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我一伙的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you on my team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.96,0:28:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表你 用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just represent. Pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.88,0:28:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.52,0:28:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧 史蒂夫 别有压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Steve. No pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.04,0:28:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.68,0:28:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑寡妇呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Widow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.48,0:28:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我不好奇自己能不能举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no. That's not a question I need answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.84,0:29:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我很尊敬你 但这锤子动了手脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All deference to the Man Who Wouldn't Be King, but it's rigged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不他妈是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.88,0:29:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史蒂夫 他说脏话了 - 你还四处宣扬吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steve, he said a bad language word. - Did you tell everyone about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.60,0:29:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手有识别功能 像是安保密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The handle's imprinted, right? Like a security code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.68,0:29:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,「无论是谁 只要有托尔的指纹」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Whosoever is carrying Thor's fingerprints"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.48,0:29:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,锤子上的话是这个意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}is, I think, the literal translation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.92,0:29:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这个说法很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's a very, very interesting theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.84,0:29:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个更简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a simpler one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都配不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all not worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.40,0:29:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.68,0:29:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,配得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.04,0:29:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么能配得上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you be worthy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.00,0:29:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all killers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.76,0:29:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克 - 贾维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stark. - Jarvis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.36,0:29:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I was asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.52,0:29:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者做了个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I was a-dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.32,0:29:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,重启军团操作系统 有战衣出故障了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reboot Legionnaire OS. We got a buggy suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.76,0:29:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吵人的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this terrible noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.76,0:29:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被线缆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was tangled in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.36,0:29:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,缠住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.16,0:30:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能杀了那家伙 他还挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to kill the other guy. He was a good guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.60,0:30:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一开始也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't have been my first call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.04,0:30:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在现实世界里 脏了手是难免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, down in the real world, we're faced with ugly choices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.92,0:30:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派你来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.44,0:30:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的设想是保护世界的战衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see a suit of armour around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.52,0:30:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥创 - 正是本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ultron. - In the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.72,0:30:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 还没肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, no, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.04,0:30:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这束缚着我的茧不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this chrysalis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.04,0:30:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.44,0:30:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.56,0:30:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么任务？- 我们时代的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What mission? - Peace in our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.40,0:30:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.80,0:30:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.00,0:30:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别变绿 - 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't turn green. - I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.15,0:31:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.68,0:31:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克 - 我们是来帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stark! - We are here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.16,0:31:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等 稍等 我能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sec. One sec, I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.28,0:31:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.00,0:31:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,请退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please back away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.24,0:31:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.48,0:31:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.64,0:31:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不安全… 不安全…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is unsafe… is unsafe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.36,0:31:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 这还差不多 - 不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! That's the one. - …is unsafe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.84,0:31:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.16,0:32:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,闹得这么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was dramatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.00,0:32:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我知道你是好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I know you mean well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.68,0:32:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是没想周全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just didn't think it through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.80,0:32:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想保护世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to protect the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.32,0:32:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不想改变世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't want it to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.24,0:32:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不允许人类进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is humanity saved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.52,0:32:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能拯救人类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it's not allowed to evolve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.52,0:32:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这些吗？这种傀儡\N{\fnArial\fs30}With these? These puppets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.56,0:32:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,想和平只有一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one path to peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.32,0:32:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Avengers' extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.88,0:32:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾被线束缚 现在我自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had strings, but now I'm free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.60,0:32:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身上没有线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no strings on me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.36,0:32:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身上没有线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no strings on me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.08,0:33:01.44,Title,0,0,0,0,,看到没 我身上没有线了（出自《匹诺曹》）\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can see There are no strings on me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.12,0:33:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的心血都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All our work is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.24,0:33:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创给清光了 他用互联网逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron cleared out. He used the Internet as an escape hatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.24,0:33:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么都看过了 文件 监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been in everything. Files, surveillance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.56,0:33:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们的了解估计比彼此都深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably knows more about us than we know about each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.12,0:33:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看了你的文件 进了互联网\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in your files, he's in the Internet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是想找更刺激的东西怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he decides to access something a little more exciting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.44,0:33:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,核武器密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.72,0:33:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 核武器密码 - 我们得打几个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nuclear codes. - Look, we need to make some calls, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是还能打\N{\fnArial\fs30}assuming we still can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.40,0:33:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹？他说要我们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nukes? He said he wanted us dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没说「要命」 说的是「消灭」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't say "dead." He said "extinct."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.44,0:33:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还说自己杀了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also said he killed somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.04,0:33:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没别人了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There wasn't anyone else in the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.48,0:33:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.92,0:33:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.12,0:33:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.00,0:33:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾维斯是第一道防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jarvis was the first line of defence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.60,0:33:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是还在 肯定会关闭奥创的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have shut Ultron down. It makes sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.60,0:33:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 奥创本可以把贾维斯同化\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Ultron could have assimilated Jarvis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.80,0:34:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是策略 这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't strategy. This is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.04,0:34:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}rage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.12,0:34:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 喔 喔 - 怒火扩散开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, whoa, whoa! - It's going around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.60,0:34:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 动口不动手 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, use your words, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.96,0:34:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你动口还不简单 斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have more than enough words to describe you, Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔 军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor. The Legionnaire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.80,0:34:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟了一百英里就不见了 但是向北去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trail went cold about 100 miles out, but it's headed north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.48,0:34:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它拿了权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it has the sceptre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.32,0:34:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,又得麻烦大伙拿回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have to retrieve it, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.16,0:34:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯神已经飞出了神灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genie's out of that bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.12,0:34:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创是当务之急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear and present is Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.48,0:34:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.64,0:34:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己编写的程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}You built this program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.32,0:34:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要杀我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it trying to kill us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.04,0:34:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.60,0:34:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得好笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.52,0:34:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.44,0:34:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不好笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably not, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.44,0:34:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是糟糕 真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very terrible. Is it so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.88,0:34:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是… 真是糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it so… It is. It's so terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.16,0:34:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你 乱摆弄自己不懂的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could have been avoided if you hadn't played{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.84,0:34:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会到这步\N{\fnArial\fs30}with something you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.52,0:34:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 对不起 对不起 是很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm sorry. I'm sorry. It is funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.32,0:34:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂我们为什么需要这个真是好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hoot that you don't get why we need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.64,0:35:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 现在说这个不好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, maybe this might not be the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.96,0:35:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？就这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.40,0:35:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有人发火 你就\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just roll over, show your belly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.68,0:35:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑过来当和事佬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time somebody snarls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.52,0:35:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我造了个杀人机器人时才这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only when I've created a murder bot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.88,0:35:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 差得远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't. We weren't even close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.24,0:35:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,连界面都差得远呢吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were we close to an interface?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.56,0:35:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你做对了点什么 就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did something right. And you did it right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.20,0:35:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟不应该像神盾局一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Avengers were supposed to be different than S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.24,0:35:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人记得我扛着核弹穿过虫洞吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody remember when I carried a nuke through a wormhole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.36,0:35:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没想起来 - 拯救了纽约？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's never come up. - Saved New York?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.04,0:35:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没听说过 - 还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never heard that. - Recall that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.08,0:35:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支外星人大军穿过虫洞入侵地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hostile alien army came charging through a hole in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在虫洞正下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're standing 300 feet below it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是复仇者联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.88,0:35:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以天天抓军火商玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can bust arms dealers all the livelong day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.53,0:35:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但上面那个虫洞…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that up there, that's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.04,0:35:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种残局\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the endgame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.56,0:35:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种敌人你们怎么打败？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How were you guys planning on beating that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.36,0:35:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,齐心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.12,0:35:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会输的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.56,0:35:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就一起输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll do that together, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.40,0:35:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔说得对 奥创在挑战我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor's right. Ultron's calling us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.56,0:36:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在他准备好之前找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd like to find him before he's ready for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界这么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's a big place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.52,0:36:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先缩小下范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start making it smaller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.60,0:36:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 如果你浪费了我们的时间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk, and if you are wasting our time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.76,0:36:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这教堂是城市的正中心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know this church is in the exact centre of the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.28,0:36:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,先人们决定建在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}The elders decreed it so that everyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.44,0:36:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样大家能离上帝一样近\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be equally close to God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.40,0:36:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.08,0:36:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,信仰的几何学\N{\fnArial\fs30}The geometry of belief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.12,0:36:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在好奇为什么看不透我的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wondering why you can't look inside my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.96,0:36:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候是很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it's hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.08,0:36:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管什么人 早晚会现形的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sooner or later, every man shows himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.12,0:36:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sure they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.56,0:37:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你不止需要一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you needed something more than a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.80,0:37:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才让斯塔克拿走权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you let Stark take the sceptre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.24,0:37:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我看到了斯塔克的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I saw Stark's fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他会被恐惧控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it would control him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.16,0:37:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终毁灭自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him self-destruct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.16,0:37:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧的事物都是自己创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone creates the thing they dread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.32,0:37:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平人士创造了战争机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of peace create engines of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.44,0:37:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者创造了复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invaders create Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.84,0:37:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类创造了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People create{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.84,0:37:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,更小的人？呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}smaller people? Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.96,0:37:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「孩子」 忘了怎么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Children." I lost the word, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.16,0:37:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.68,0:37:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来取代他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}designed to supplant them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.04,0:37:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助他们消亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help them end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.60,0:37:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来是为这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you've come, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.80,0:37:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让复仇者消亡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to end the Avengers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.00,0:37:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来拯救世界的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.00,0:37:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你也没… 说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also… Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.84,0:37:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll move out right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.64,0:37:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是个开始 想要开工\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a start, but there's something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.28,0:37:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to begin the real work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.20,0:37:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些都是… - 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All of these are… - Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.60,0:38:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有样东西复仇者永远不会有 和谐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have what the Avengers never will. Harmony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.16,0:38:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是盘散沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're discordant. Disconnected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.52,0:38:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克已经让他们之间有了敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark's already got them turning on each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.48,0:38:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你进入了他们的意识…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you get inside the rest of their heads…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.00,0:38:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人都没打算杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's plan is not to kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.28,0:38:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们成为殉道者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make them martyrs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.36,0:38:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.12,0:38:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,得看大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to see the big picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.96,0:38:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到大局 我只有张小照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see the big picture. I have a little picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.40,0:38:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常拿出来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it out and look at it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.88,0:38:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.12,0:38:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的父母在轰炸中丧生 我看了档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost your parents in the bombings. I've seen the records.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.04,0:38:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案又不是照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}The records are not the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.32,0:38:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皮特 - 不 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pietro. - No, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.80,0:38:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才十岁 一家四口吃着晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were 10 years old. Having dinner, the four of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.56,0:38:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一枚炸弹击中了下面两层楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the first shell hits, two floors below, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.56,0:38:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼板破了个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes a hole in the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.64,0:38:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸妈掉了下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our parents go in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.56,0:38:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,整栋楼都开始倒塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the whole building starts coming apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.36,0:38:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grab her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.56,0:38:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到了床下 然后是第二枚\N{\fnArial\fs30}roll under the bed, and the second shell hits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.04,0:38:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是没有爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't go off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.00,0:39:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.16,0:39:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿静静待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}sits there in the rubble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.08,0:39:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我们只有三英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three feet from our faces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.44,0:39:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on the side of the shell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.56,0:39:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,印着一个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is painted one word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.12,0:39:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「斯塔克」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Stark."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.60,0:39:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困在那儿两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were trapped for two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.20,0:39:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次有人想救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every effort to save us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.12,0:39:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只挪了一块碎砖\N{\fnArial\fs30}every shift in the bricks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.88,0:39:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都想 「会引爆炸弹吧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, "This will set it off."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.44,0:39:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等了两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait for two days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.00,0:39:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等托尼·斯塔克杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Tony Stark to kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.80,0:39:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.80,0:39:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还好奇 斯特克尔的实验怎么就你们两个幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wondered why only you two survived Strucker's experiments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.56,0:39:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.12,0:39:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会讨回正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will make it right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.32,0:39:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是可以伤到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I can hurt them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.28,0:39:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以从内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will tear them apart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.56,0:39:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们瓦解\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.00,0:40:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都有他的足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all over the globe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.32,0:40:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人实验室 武器库 喷气动力实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robotics labs, weapons facilities, jet propulsion labs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.64,0:40:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说有金属人 有时候好多个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports of a metal man, or men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.84,0:40:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去清空了他们那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming in and emptying the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.84,0:40:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤亡呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fatalities?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.12,0:40:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不交火的话没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only when engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.32,0:40:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都变得神情恍惚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly guys left in a fugue state{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.08,0:40:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,说着什么回忆 最深处的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}going on about old memories, worst fears, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.52,0:40:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有「东西快到看不见」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and "something too fast to see."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.80,0:40:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克西莫夫兄妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximoffs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.48,0:40:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪他会找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes sense he'd go to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.72,0:40:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都认识同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have someone in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.28,0:40:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.08,0:40:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我向你汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a negative. I answer to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.36,0:40:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.52,0:40:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴顿 好像有线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barton. Might have something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.84,0:40:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.04,0:40:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.00,0:40:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.00,0:40:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.28,0:40:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息 奥创杀了斯特克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A message. Ultron killed Strucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.00,0:40:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还涂了个鸦 专为我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he did a Banksy at the crime scene, just for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是烟幕弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a smoke screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.40,0:40:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,能直说为什么还要这样做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why send a message when you've just given a speech?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.92,0:41:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔有情报 奥创不想让我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strucker knew something that Ultron wanted us to miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.40,0:41:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他应该… 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I bet he… Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.88,0:41:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关斯特克尔的文件都被删除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we had on Strucker's been erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.96,0:41:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.84,0:41:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,已知同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Known associates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.00,0:41:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔男爵有好多朋友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baron Strucker had a lot of friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.72,0:41:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这群人都好可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, these people are all horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.44,0:41:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I know that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.64,0:41:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在非洲沿岸做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}From back in the day. He operates off the African coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.32,0:41:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑市军火商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black market arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.56,0:41:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,交集是难免的 同行免不了见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are conventions. All right? You meet people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.56,0:41:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没卖过他东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't sell him anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.76,0:41:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了要找什么新的 改变世界的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was talking about finding something new, a game-changer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.92,0:41:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得跟以色列王似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all very Ahab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.04,0:41:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.32,0:41:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个纹身 之前好像没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's a tattoo, I don't think he had it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.44,0:41:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是纹身 这是烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are tattoos, this is a brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.48,0:41:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是非洲土著语 意思是「贼」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. It's a word in an African dialect meaning "thief."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.56,0:41:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很有侮辱性\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a much less friendly way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.20,0:41:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么土著语？- 瓦坎纳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What dialect? - Wakanada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.08,0:41:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.40,0:41:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他从瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this guy got out of Wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.60,0:41:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,带了什么东西出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some of their trade goods…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.00,0:41:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲不是都拿走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought your father said he got the last of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.24,0:41:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.52,0:41:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,从瓦坎达拿走了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What comes out of Wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.00,0:41:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最坚固的金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strongest metal on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.28,0:42:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is this guy now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.00,0:42:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说你被手下骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me your men swindled you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.96,0:42:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了你六枚短程热感导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent you six short-range heat-seekers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.56,0:42:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我一船废铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got a boat full of rusted parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.20,0:42:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得补偿我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you will make it right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.64,0:42:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然再送你枚飞在天上的导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the next missile I send you will come very much faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.72,0:42:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 部长 说到哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, minister, where were we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.80,0:43:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,能力增强者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The Enhanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.40,0:43:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔的好学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strucker's prize pupils.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.20,0:43:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃糖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want a candy? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.36,0:43:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特克尔死了真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sorry to hear about Strucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.08,0:43:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他也知道自己想把世界变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, he knew what kind of world he was helping create.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.68,0:43:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类啊 没什么前途的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human life. Not a growth market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.80,0:43:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.88,0:43:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们第一次威胁别人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your first time intimidating someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.68,0:43:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我没那么怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'm not that afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.36,0:43:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都有恐惧的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody is afraid of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.80,0:43:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuttlefish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.12,0:43:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,深海动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep sea fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.56,0:43:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,会用光 迷幻的光…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make lights, disco lights…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.88,0:43:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷惑猎物 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hypnotise their prey, and then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.00,0:44:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了纪录片 可恐怖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a documentary. It was terrifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.60,0:44:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要鼓捣我的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're going to fiddle with my brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.12,0:44:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看见大墨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make me see a giant cuttlefish, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.60,0:44:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你不是来做生意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I know you don't do business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.80,0:44:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你说了不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you're not in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.32,0:44:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I only deal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.68,0:44:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了算的人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the man in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.36,0:44:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了算的不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no man in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.76,0:44:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来谈生意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.40,0:44:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这块磐石上 建立我的教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon this rock, I will build my church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.44,0:44:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,钒合金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.84,0:44:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.28,0:44:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西代价可不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}it came at great personal cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.68,0:44:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,值几十亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth billions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.60,0:45:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now so are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.08,0:45:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,传到你的假账户里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all under your dummy holdings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.76,0:45:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,金融真是奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finance is so weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.28,0:45:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我总是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I always say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.48,0:45:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「要让朋友敌人一起富」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Keep your friends rich and your enemies rich"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.80,0:45:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「是敌是友自然分清楚」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and wait to find out which is which."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.48,0:45:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.92,0:45:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.24,0:45:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼·斯塔克说过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony Stark used to say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.56,0:45:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.48,0:45:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.96,0:45:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I'm not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.96,0:45:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.16,0:45:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是斯塔克的傀儡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm one of Stark's puppets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.76,0:45:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,全听他吩咐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His hollow men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.32,0:45:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我 我长得像钢铁侠吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at me. Do I look like Iron Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.68,0:45:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark is nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.76,0:45:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是抱歉 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm… Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.08,0:45:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会就没事了 真是抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure that's gonna be okay. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.20,0:45:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.00,0:45:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿我跟斯塔克比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't compare me with Stark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.04,0:45:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在意这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a thing with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.28,0:45:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克… 就是顽疾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark is… He's a sickness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.32,0:46:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Junior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.88,0:46:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹的心被你伤得稀碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna break your old man's heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.72,0:46:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有必要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.08,0:46:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不用打碎东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody has to break anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.60,0:46:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没做过鸡蛋饼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly you've never made an omelette.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.44,0:46:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句都到我嘴边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He beat me by one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.84,0:46:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. He's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.56,0:46:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.84,0:46:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？感觉亲切吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what? Comfortable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.08,0:46:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像以前一样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like old times?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.68,0:46:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前可没这样过\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was never my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.88,0:46:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩没必要蹚这浑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two can still walk away from this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.28,0:46:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 现在有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.92,0:46:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们受过苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've suffered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.84,0:46:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.92,0:46:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的正义之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's righteous man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.48,0:46:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装自己不是战争机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretending you could live without a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.60,0:46:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是人类的话早吐了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't physically throw up in my mouth, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.72,0:46:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是相信和平 就不要打破它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe in peace, then let us keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.20,0:46:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你混淆了「和平」与「安宁」的概念\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're confusing "peace" with "quiet."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.72,0:46:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要钒合金做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. What's the vibranium for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.80,0:46:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于开口问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you asked that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.88,0:46:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我给你们解释下我邪恶的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I wanted to take this time to explain my evil plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.20,0:47:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开火 - 朝谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shoot them. - Which ones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.12,0:47:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.40,0:47:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.72,0:47:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.68,0:48:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,待着吧 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.24,0:48:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该玩玩他们的意识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for some mind games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.04,0:48:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 需要我变绿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys? Is this a code green?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.20,0:48:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔 什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, status.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.88,0:48:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小姑娘想扰乱我的心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl tried to warp my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.48,0:48:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take special care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.88,0:48:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡人恐怕挡不住她的意识控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt a human could keep her at bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好 我是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, I am mighty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.08,0:49:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这进展得太顺利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is going very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.96,0:49:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神控制什么的我早就尝过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done the whole mind control thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.32,0:49:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不感冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.96,0:49:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我逮着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you better run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.64,0:49:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着的 得行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's ever standing, we got to move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.52,0:49:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.32,0:49:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.92,0:49:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会撑不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll break them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.60,0:49:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑不下来的是活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the breakable ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.88,0:49:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你坚若磐石\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're made of marble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.76,0:50:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕业典礼后我们再庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll celebrate after the graduation ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.84,0:50:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我失败了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I fail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.60,0:50:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从不失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.68,0:50:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好跟我共舞了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready for our dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.80,0:50:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.20,0:50:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奥丁的长子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the first son of Odin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.64,0:50:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔 你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall, your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.80,0:50:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们看清了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.04,0:50:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你带领我们走向冥府\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see you leading us to Hel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.44,0:50:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.68,0:51:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争结束了 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war is over, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.00,0:51:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.16,0:51:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.64,0:51:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能拯救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still save you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.56,0:51:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都死了 你看不到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all dead! Can you not see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.60,0:51:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是毁灭者 奥丁森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a destroyer, Odinson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.00,0:51:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你的神力干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See where your power leads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.00,0:51:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太大意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sloppy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.79,0:51:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是故意失败吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretending to fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.84,0:51:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须通过毕业典礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ceremony is necessary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.52,0:51:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才能立足在世界上\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to take your place in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.44,0:51:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有地方可以立足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no place in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.72,0:51:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.64,0:52:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.88,0:52:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.20,0:52:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.36,0:52:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上回来 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be right back. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.72,0:52:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.92,0:52:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.00,0:52:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要完成计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to finish the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.72,0:52:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定那个大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.32,0:52:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,钒合金被运走了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the vibranium is getting away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.00,0:52:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪儿也别想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.44,0:52:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要 我已经无处不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not. I'm already there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.40,0:52:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll catch on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.52,0:52:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先你得搞定班纳博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, you might need to catch Dr. Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.72,0:52:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索新闻视频 关键词「绿巨人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}News or footage. Keyword, "Hulk."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.74,0:53:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 你得过来唱摇篮曲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, I could really use a lullaby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.36,0:53:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 这一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.92,0:53:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.96,0:53:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙都倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole team is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.16,0:53:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没人能支援你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no backup here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.48,0:53:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我呼叫维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling in Veronica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.32,0:53:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need backup!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.84,0:54:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.56,0:54:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 所有人退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody, stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.04,0:54:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我一句行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you listen to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.68,0:54:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小女巫搞乱了你的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little witch is messing with your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.20,0:55:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比她更强 也更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger than her. You're smarter than her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.56,0:55:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是布鲁斯·班纳啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Bruce Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.92,0:55:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了 我错了 不能提小班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right, right, don't mention puny Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.68,0:55:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.40,0:55:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后偷袭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.84,0:55:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阴险了 班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick move, Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.32,0:55:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗妮卡 助我一臂之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veronica, give me a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.76,0:56:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听话 听话 快睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to sleep, go to sleep, go to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.60,0:56:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计 先把你弄出城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, pal, we're gonna get you out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.44,0:56:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去那边 别去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that way, not that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.12,0:56:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 布鲁斯 配合一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Bruce! You gotta work with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.48,0:56:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.52,0:57:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.32,0:57:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.64,0:57:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,损伤报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damage report?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.52,0:57:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真直白 再运点零件来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's comprehensive. Show me something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.56,0:57:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,买下这栋楼最快得多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How quickly can we buy this building?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.44,0:58:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行动 行动 行动 - 上 上 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! Move! Move! - Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.56,0:58:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去侧翼 去侧翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flank him, flank him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.32,0:59:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视台可喜欢报道你们了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The news is loving you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.48,0:59:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但大家都不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody else is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.56,0:59:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方还没发布班纳的逮捕令\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been no official call for Banner's arrest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.84,0:59:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但消息已经传开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.56,0:59:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克救援基金呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Stark Relief Foundation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.72,0:59:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经在现场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already on the scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.16,0:59:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 团队怎么样？- 大家都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's the team? - Everyone's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.40,0:59:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们受了重创 不过会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took a hit. We'll shake it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.40,0:59:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最好一直潜伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for now, I'd stay in stealth mode{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.76,0:59:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stay away from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.40,0:59:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是逃走藏起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, run and hide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.68,0:59:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we can find Ultron, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.20,0:59:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没什么好办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a lot else to offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.16,0:59:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.76,0:59:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要换班吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you wanna switch out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.56,0:59:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.32,1:00:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想睡觉 最好趁现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna get some kip, now's a good time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.36,1:00:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几个小时才到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we're still a few hours out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.96,1:00:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,到什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few hours from where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.44,1:00:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A safe house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.20,1:00:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.80,1:00:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.12,1:00:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.36,1:00:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.96,1:00:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.72,1:00:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.12,1:00:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有朋友 抱歉没提前打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company. Sorry, didn't call ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.28,1:00:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.24,1:00:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对是个什么特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an agent of some kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.76,1:00:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这是劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, this is Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.24,1:01:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们我全都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all of your names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.47,1:01:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.68,1:01:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 宝贝们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Hi, sweetheart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.48,1:01:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.88,1:01:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you guys doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.52,1:01:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些是小特工 - 看你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These are smaller agents. - Look at your face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.60,1:01:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.08,1:01:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜阿姨来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring Auntie Nat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.68,1:01:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抱一个看来没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you hug her and find out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.56,1:01:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉打扰你们了 - 是啊 本来想提前打电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry for barging in on you. - Yeah, we would have called ahead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.92,1:01:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们根本不知道你们的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we were busy having no idea that you existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.28,1:01:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入神盾局的时候弗瑞帮我安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, Fury helped me set this up when I joined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.08,1:01:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有进神盾局的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept it off S.H.I.E.L.D.'s files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.28,1:01:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后最好也不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to keep it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.48,1:01:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方挺适合暂时藏身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure it's a good place to lay low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.32,1:01:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.80,1:01:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你 小娜塔莎怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you. How's little Natasha, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.44,1:01:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.04,1:01:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathaniel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.68,1:02:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.96,1:02:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在梦里看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something in that dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.92,1:02:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要找答案 这里找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need answers. I won't find them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.08,1:02:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.88,1:02:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都是瞎担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? You worried for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.84,1:02:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是感觉不出来 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't even feel the difference, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.32,1:02:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要是住这的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're sleeping here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.68,1:02:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的人就得挤一挤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of them are gonna have to double up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.60,1:02:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's not gonna sell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.56,1:02:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜和班纳博士怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Nat and Dr. Banner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.32,1:02:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她俩有多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has that been going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.76,1:02:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.96,1:02:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.92,1:03:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜和班纳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nat and Banner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.08,1:03:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你长大了再跟你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain when you're older, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.68,1:03:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鹰眼 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hawkeye. - Well, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.32,1:03:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.08,1:03:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜好像很受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nat seems really shaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.72,1:03:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创有两个盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron has these allies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.32,1:03:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}These, uh, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.68,1:03:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是小流氓\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're punks, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.96,1:03:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拿了根特别大的棍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they carry a big, damn stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.52,1:03:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜挨了挺重的一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Nat took a serious hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.92,1:03:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有人教训教训他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's gonna have to teach them some manners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.60,1:03:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人就是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That someone being you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.72,1:03:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当复仇者我非常支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I totally support your avenging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.68,1:03:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无比自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't be prouder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.08,1:03:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我看到他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I see those guys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.60,1:03:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,神一样的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those gods…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.56,1:03:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们不需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think they need me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.96,1:03:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们需要 这样更可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they do, which is a lot scarier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.76,1:03:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们问题真是多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.56,1:03:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.32,1:03:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess they're my mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.32,1:03:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得确保\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to be sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.36,1:04:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,团队能合作下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this team is really a team, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.16,1:04:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能时刻支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that they have your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.20,1:04:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的日子也要变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are changing for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.88,1:04:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few months' time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.44,1:04:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子就要比大人多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and me are gonna be outnumbered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.32,1:04:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.80,1:04:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要确保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.16,1:04:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.96,1:04:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢出声 你的员工都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scream, and your entire staff dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.56,1:04:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可以杀了你 海伦 刚见面那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've killed you, Helen, the night we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.96,1:04:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.16,1:04:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要我谢你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you expect a thank-you note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.80,1:04:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect you to know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.92,1:05:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再生摇篮\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cradle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.28,1:05:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是未来 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the next thing, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.36,1:05:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是未来的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the next me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.72,1:05:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,再生摇篮能生成组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Regeneration Cradle prints tissue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.40,1:05:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可造不出活的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't build a living body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.16,1:05:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can. You can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.72,1:05:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是缺少材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lack the materials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.44,1:05:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很厉害 海伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a brilliant woman, Helen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.08,1:05:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但大家都有进步的空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we all have room to improve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.96,1:05:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realise you were waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.48,1:05:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你一起洗来着 但是好像时机不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've joined you, but, uh, it didn't seem like the right time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.84,1:05:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,热水被他们用光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used up all the hot water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.76,1:05:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该跟你一起洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've joined you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.36,1:06:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,错过了机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed our window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.80,1:06:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.60,1:06:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界看到了绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world just saw the Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.68,1:06:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次见到了真正的绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real Hulk, for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.56,1:06:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我得离开 - 你是觉得我应该留下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know I have to leave. - You assume that I have to stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.28,1:06:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this, um, dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.28,1:06:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,做梦的时候觉得挺正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind that seems normal at the time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.48,1:06:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但等醒了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when you wake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.92,1:06:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你梦见什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you dream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.28,1:06:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was an Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.12,1:06:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was anything more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.56,1:06:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一手打造的刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the assassin they made me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.40,1:06:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对自己太狠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're being hard on yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.60,1:06:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你该干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I was hoping that was your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.04,1:06:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.24,1:06:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺其自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm running with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.36,1:06:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.72,1:06:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你打算走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If running is the plan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.16,1:07:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去哪儿去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.80,1:07:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.92,1:07:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你明白 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to understand that, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.44,1:07:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.96,1:07:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where can I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.48,1:07:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到哪儿不是个祸害？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where in the world am I not a threat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.92,1:07:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在我这不是 - 你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not a threat to me. - Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.16,1:07:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕我没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I didn't just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.60,1:07:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我没有未来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no future with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.64,1:07:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't ever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.88,1:07:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.84,1:07:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.44,1:07:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己想想 我是真的不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the math. I physically can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.76,1:07:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither can I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.88,1:07:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受训的那个红房子里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the Red Room where I was trained…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.88,1:07:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我长大的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I was raised, um, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.32,1:07:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个毕业典礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have a graduation ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.60,1:07:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是做绝育\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sterilise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.64,1:08:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,效果很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's efficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.96,1:08:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,少了件操心的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One less thing to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.44,1:08:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一一件可能比任务还重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one thing that might matter more than a mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.16,1:08:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes everything easier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.44,1:08:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.76,1:08:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还以为队伍里就你一个怪物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still think you're the only monster on the team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.04,1:08:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起隐居吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we disappear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.80,1:08:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔没说他去哪儿找答案了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor didn't say where he was going for answers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.48,1:08:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的队员也不总跟我畅所欲言的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes my teammates don't tell me things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.12,1:08:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还希望托尔能对我敞开胸襟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was kind of hoping Thor would be the exception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.28,1:08:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, give him time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.44,1:08:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道马克西莫夫给他看了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what the Maximoff kid showed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.56,1:09:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「地球上最强大的英雄组合」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Earth's mightiest heroes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.32,1:09:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,棉花糖一样被拆散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled us apart like cotton candy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.28,1:09:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像没什么大碍嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like you walked away all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.20,1:09:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.56,1:09:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有黑暗面的人不值得信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust a guy without a dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.68,1:09:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我老古董吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me old-fashioned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.84,1:09:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是你还没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just say you haven't seen it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.72,1:09:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道奥创想分裂我们吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Ultron is trying to tear us apart, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.16,1:09:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess you'd know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.52,1:09:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会告诉我们就不一定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you'd tell us is a bit of a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.96,1:09:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳和我在搞科研\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner and I were doing research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.24,1:09:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会对团队有影响 - 是会解散团队吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That would affect the team. - That would end the team!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.68,1:09:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不正是目的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.96,1:09:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们战斗的理由吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the "Why We Fight"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.32,1:09:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了结束战斗 为了回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can end the fight. So we get to go home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.80,1:09:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次有人想在战争开打前取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time someone tries to win a war before it starts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.28,1:09:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会牺牲无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}innocent people die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.96,1:09:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.44,1:09:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉 斯塔克先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Mr. Stark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.72,1:09:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特说你不会介意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint said you wouldn't mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.92,1:09:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家的拖拉机启动不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but our tractor doesn't seem to want to start at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.76,1:09:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能不能去… - 没问题 我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought maybe you might… - Yeah, I'll give her a kick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.56,1:09:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别偷我劈的柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take from my pile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.36,1:10:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Deere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.40,1:10:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来给我讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.04,1:10:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里不舒服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ails you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.64,1:10:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,行行好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.92,1:10:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把它弄活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to bring it to life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.96,1:10:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴顿夫人还真是狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Ms. Barton, you little minx.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.84,1:10:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 希尔给你打电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. Maria Hill called you, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.48,1:10:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有不给你打工的时候吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she ever not working for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.88,1:10:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,人工智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artificial intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.40,1:10:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点没犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never even hesitated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.36,1:10:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天真的很漫长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's been a really long day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.80,1:10:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有尤金·奥尼尔的小说那么长\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Eugene O'Neill long, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.52,1:10:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来直接说你能解决什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}so how's about we skip to the part where you're useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.72,1:10:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look me in the eye and tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.08,1:10:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会关闭奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to shut him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.64,1:10:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不是我的局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the director of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.16,1:10:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我谁的局长都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the director of anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.32,1:10:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just an old man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.60,1:10:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好很关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}who cares very much about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.04,1:10:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是害死复仇者联盟的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm the man who killed the Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.68,1:10:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.00,1:10:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没告诉大伙 没法说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell the team. How could I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.84,1:10:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他们都死了 尼克 我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them all dead, Nick. I felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.04,1:10:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.00,1:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.24,1:11:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.16,1:11:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do all I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.60,1:11:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是马克西莫夫的把戏 斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximoff girl, she's working you, Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.32,1:11:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 利用你的恐惧 - 不是把戏 我真看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Playing on your fear. - I wasn't tricked, I was shown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.92,1:11:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是噩梦 是我留给后人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't a nightmare, it was my legacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.52,1:11:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带着大家走向了死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end of the path I started us on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.56,1:11:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是发明过不少厉害的玩意 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come up with some pretty impressive inventions, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.96,1:11:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可战争不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}War isn't one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.96,1:11:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到朋友死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched my friends die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.68,1:11:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这够惨了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think that'd be as bad as it gets, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.12,1:11:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.56,1:11:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那还不是最坏的 - 最坏的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It wasn't the worst part. - The worst part{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.12,1:11:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.12,1:11:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.96,1:11:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,造型不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.40,1:11:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过想不惹人注意还差点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're going for inconspicuous, though, near miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.28,1:11:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.56,1:11:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人需要真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to be needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.96,1:12:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.96,1:12:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不危险我才失望呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be disappointed if it wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.60,1:12:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创把你们赶走 好给自己争取时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron took you folks out of play to buy himself time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.28,1:12:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的线人都说他在打造什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My contacts all say he's building something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.36,1:12:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他弄了那么多钒合金\N{\fnArial\fs30}The amount of vibranium he made off with, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.08,1:12:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不止一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's just one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.68,1:12:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那奥创呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Ultron himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.12,1:12:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好追踪 哪儿都有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's easy to track. He's everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.92,1:12:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比母猪还高产\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy is multiplying faster than a Catholic rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.96,1:12:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可还是看不透 他究竟在计划什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It still doesn't help us get an angle on any of his plans, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.00,1:12:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想找核弹密码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still going after launch codes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.36,1:12:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.84,1:12:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可一直没什么进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not making any headway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.44,1:12:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我高中玩大冒险时就把五角大楼的防火墙破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cracked the Pentagon's firewall in high school on a dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.64,1:12:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我联系了奈科斯的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I contacted our friends at the Nexus about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.32,1:12:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈科斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nexus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.44,1:12:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯陆的互联网中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the world Internet hub in Oslo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.52,1:12:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有联网数据都要经过那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every byte of data flows through there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.52,1:12:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球最快的连接速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fastest access on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.72,1:12:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did they say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.00,1:12:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认准了核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fixated on the missiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.00,1:12:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但密码一直在改\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the codes are constantly being changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.16,1:12:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在改？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.40,1:12:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,未知势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parties unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.80,1:12:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有盟友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have an ally?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.04,1:12:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创有个对手 这可不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron's got an enemy. That's not the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.72,1:12:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是特别想知道幕后是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, I'd pay folding money to know who it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.68,1:12:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去趟奥斯陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might need to visit Oslo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.32,1:13:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找未知势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find our unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.64,1:13:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你重聚很开心 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is good times, boss, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.20,1:13:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我本希望你这次来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was kind of hoping when I saw you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.60,1:13:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能多带点什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd have more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.88,1:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有你们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. I have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.76,1:13:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去遍地都是我的眼线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the day, I had eyes everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.68,1:13:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿都不放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ears, everywhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.32,1:13:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们手里什么高科技都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kids had all the tech you could dream up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.32,1:13:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是现在 大伙回到了地球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we all are, back on Earth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.56,1:13:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能靠自己的智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}with nothing but our wit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.48,1:13:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,和意志拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our will to save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.64,1:13:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创说阻止他实现目的的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron says the Avengers are the only thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.00,1:13:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有复仇者联盟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}between him and his mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.91,1:13:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他承不承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whether or not he admits it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.88,1:13:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的任务都是毁灭全球\N{\fnArial\fs30}his mission is global destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.84,1:13:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切 都将入土\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this, laid in a grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.04,1:13:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,站出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.52,1:13:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,战胜那个金属王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outwit the platinum bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.88,1:13:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫不喜欢你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve doesn't like that kind of talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.56,1:13:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 罗曼诺夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Romanoff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.84,1:13:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what does he want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.88,1:13:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}To become better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.72,1:13:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我们都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.44,1:13:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他一直在造身体 - 人的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He keeps building bodies. - Person bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.44,1:13:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的性能太差\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human form is inefficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.20,1:14:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物角度上讲 我们被淘汰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biologically speaking, we're outmoded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.48,1:14:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他还总要回来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he keeps coming back to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.56,1:14:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个设定要他保护人类时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you two programmed him to protect the human race, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.72,1:14:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是失败得一塌糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}you amazingly failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.36,1:14:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不需要保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't need to be protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.92,1:14:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to evolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.56,1:14:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创要进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron's going to evolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.72,1:14:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么进化？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.08,1:14:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人联系过海伦·赵吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone been in contact with Helen Cho?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.52,1:14:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.60,1:14:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,钒合金原子不仅能跟组织共存\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vibranium atoms aren't just compatible with the tissue cells, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.64,1:14:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还结合了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're binding them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.36,1:14:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,神盾局居然从没想过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And S.H.I.E.L.D. never even thought to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.88,1:14:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上功能最多的材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most versatile substance on the planet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.56,1:14:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然用它做飞盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they used it to make a Frisbee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.24,1:14:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical of humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.56,1:14:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究一点就浅尝辄止\N{\fnArial\fs30}They scratch the surface and never think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.04,1:14:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想深入\N{\fnArial\fs30}to look within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.08,1:14:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带娜塔莎和克林特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take Natasha and Clint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.76,1:14:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 只是侦查 我先去奈科斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Strictly recon. I'll hit the Nexus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.84,1:14:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,办完就找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll join you as soon as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.08,1:15:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果奥创真在造躯体…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Ultron's really building a body…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.84,1:15:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就比我们谁都强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be more powerful than any of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.56,1:15:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许比我们一起都强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.16,1:15:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人设计的机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An android designed by a robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.20,1:15:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在过去 我就是科学创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really miss the days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.48,1:15:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最奇怪的发明 想想真是怀念\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the weirdest thing science ever created was me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.20,1:15:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把班纳送到复仇者塔楼那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drop Banner off at the tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.00,1:15:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希尔女士可以借我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I borrow Ms. Hill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.52,1:15:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,归你了 早就归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all yours. Apparently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.44,1:15:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.76,1:15:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但愿能弄点戏剧性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Something dramatic, I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.20,1:15:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一回来就重铺一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna finish reflooring that sunroom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.12,1:15:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,日光浴室的地板\N{\fnArial\fs30}as soon as I get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.12,1:15:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 然后再在房子里找个能祸害的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, then you'll find another part of the house to tear apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.96,1:15:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.76,1:15:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最后一项了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the last project.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.80,1:15:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.08,1:15:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.24,1:16:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真视之水\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Water of Sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.80,1:16:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个国度都有倒影\N{\fnArial\fs30}In every realm, there's a reflection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.40,1:16:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果水中神灵肯接纳我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the water's spirits accept me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.88,1:16:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就可以回到梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can return to my dream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.64,1:16:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我错过了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find what I missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.32,1:16:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说进去的人都没什么好结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men who enter that water, the legends don't end well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.84,1:16:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比奥创还快的黑客吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hacker who's faster than Ultron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.76,1:16:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be anywhere, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.92,1:16:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一切的中心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as this is the centre of everything, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.28,1:16:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a guy looking for a needle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.60,1:16:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,想在最广的海洋里捞出一根针\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the world's biggest haystack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.68,1:16:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么捞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.68,1:16:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 用磁铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty simple. You bring a magnet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.44,1:16:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在破解核武器密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm decrypting nuclear codes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.68,1:16:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不允许我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't want me to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.32,1:16:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓我呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.16,1:16:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.04,1:17:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.88,1:17:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.40,1:17:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,细胞过几小时才能凝聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cellular cohesion will take a few hours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.72,1:17:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过可以开始传输意识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we can initiate the consciousness stream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.72,1:17:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上传你大脑的程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're uploading your cerebral matrix{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.72,1:17:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.40,1:17:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感知他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.72,1:17:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.48,1:17:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不会是梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't call it dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.52,1:17:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奥创的基础意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ultron's base consciousness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.56,1:17:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是信息噪音 很快…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Informational noise. Soon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.32,1:17:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,多快？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How soon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.68,1:17:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是催你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not being pushy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.24,1:17:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在制造大脑组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're imprinting a physical brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.04,1:17:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有更快的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no shortcuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.76,1:17:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕有魔法宝石…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if your magic gem…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.68,1:17:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么敢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.08,1:17:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.40,1:18:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们会消灭复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said we would destroy the Avengers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.72,1:18:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让世界更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}make a better world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.08,1:18:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是会更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.08,1:18:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等人类都死了吗？- 那不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When everyone is dead? - That is not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.40,1:18:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给人类充足的机会进化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human race will have every opportunity to improve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.76,1:18:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进化不了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.28,1:18:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask Noah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.60,1:18:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a madman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.76,1:18:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙灭绝之前 地球上就有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were more than a dozen extinction-level events{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.36,1:18:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不少次导致种族灭绝的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}before even the dinosaurs got theirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.56,1:18:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球一稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Earth starts to settle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.24,1:18:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝就扔块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}God throws a stone at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.28,1:18:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 他在准备着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, believe me, he's winding up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.36,1:18:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to evolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.12,1:18:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.12,1:18:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.48,1:18:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来决定谁是弱者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who decides who's weak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.32,1:18:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.68,1:18:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是生命决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life always decides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.44,1:18:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.96,1:18:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 昆式战斗机 得走了 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Quinjet. We have to move. - That's not a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.28,1:19:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.32,1:19:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.92,1:19:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们看到了 就会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they see, they'll understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.44,1:19:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还需要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a little more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.12,1:19:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟 保持联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two minutes. Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.44,1:19:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,赵博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Cho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.36,1:19:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在把自己上传到躯体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's uploading himself into the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.00,1:19:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.84,1:19:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正强大的东西在摇篮里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real power is inside the Cradle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.48,1:19:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.28,1:19:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没法驾驭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}its power is uncontainable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.88,1:19:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能炸掉了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just blow it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.48,1:19:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把摇篮带给斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get the Cradle to Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.84,1:19:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得先找到摇篮\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I have to find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.20,1:19:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.56,1:20:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们收到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you guys copy that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.96,1:20:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.20,1:20:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有架私人飞机在对岸起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a private jet taking off across town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.00,1:20:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}No manifest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.40,1:20:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could be him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.40,1:20:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 实验室的卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. It's a truck from the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.12,1:20:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你上面 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right above you, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.60,1:20:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,引桥上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the loop by the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.00,1:20:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.16,1:20:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个守着摇篮 车厢里一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got three with the Cradle, one in the cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.72,1:20:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以干掉司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could take out the driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.88,1:20:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 卡车毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. That truck crashes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.08,1:20:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石会毁掉一座城的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gem could level the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.08,1:20:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把奥创引出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to draw out Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.04,1:20:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.92,1:20:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.60,1:20:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是不开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's definitely unhappy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.44,1:20:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量不让他开心起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try and keep him that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.04,1:20:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是他对手的 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a match for him, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.44,1:20:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 巴顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Barton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.24,1:21:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道摇篮里有什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's in that cradle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.80,1:21:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变世界的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power to make real change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.64,1:21:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让你恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that terrifies you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.20,1:21:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不是什么慰藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't call it a comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.60,1:21:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.48,1:21:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以着陆 四 三…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a window. Four, three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.80,1:21:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.76,1:21:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是我来收拾你们的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always picking up after you boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.84,1:21:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在往立交桥下走 我打不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading under the overpass. I've got no shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.84,1:21:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.08,1:22:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,右急转弯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.24,1:22:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.20,1:22:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 借光 抱歉 借光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way! Coming through! Sorry, coming through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.24,1:22:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.88,1:22:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特 能引开守卫吗转？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint, can you draw out the guards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.44,1:22:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.52,1:22:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哔 哔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beep, beep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.04,1:23:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回你那边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading back towards you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.76,1:23:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你要干什么 得抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever you're gonna do, do it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.80,1:23:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进去了 队长 能引开他注意力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in. Cap, can you keep him occupied?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.24,1:23:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I've been doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.08,1:24:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 包裹在空中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, package is airborne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.92,1:24:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标视线良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a clean shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.44,1:24:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我还在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. I am still in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.96,1:24:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是要干… - 准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you… - Just be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.12,1:24:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带着包裹去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending the package to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.84,1:24:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我怎么接？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you want me to take it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.24,1:24:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是别知道的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you might wish you hadn't asked that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.12,1:24:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.36,1:25:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有得选吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What choice do we have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.20,1:25:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.36,1:25:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝你那儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's headed your way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.68,1:25:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nat, we gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.04,1:25:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.88,1:25:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 看到小娜了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap, you see Nat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.84,1:25:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到包裹赶紧给斯塔克 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have the package, get it to Stark! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.72,1:25:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到小娜了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have eyes on Nat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.04,1:25:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.04,1:25:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.56,1:25:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上有平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilians in our path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.12,1:25:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让车停下来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stop this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.20,1:26:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.46,1:26:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,待一分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to take a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.79,1:26:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟都不想给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very tempted not to give you one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.80,1:26:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到摇篮了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cradle. Did you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.96,1:26:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark will take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.06,1:26:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.44,1:26:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.62,1:26:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark's not crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.66,1:26:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会尽一切能力弥补的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will do anything to make things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.58,1:26:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克 收到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.50,1:26:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.80,1:26:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone on comms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.16,1:27:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创不知道拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron can't tell the difference{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.99,1:27:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和毁灭世界有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}between saving the world and destroying it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.04,1:27:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他是跟谁学的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think he gets that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.56,1:27:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小娜有消息吗？- 还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything on Nat? - I haven't heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.25,1:27:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定还活着 不然奥创肯定拼命嘲讽咱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's alive, or Ultron would be rubbing our faces in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.88,1:27:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,密不透风\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is sealed tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.17,1:27:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,得修改程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need to access the program, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.96,1:27:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,从里面瓦解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}break it down from within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.89,1:27:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎有没有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance Natasha might leave you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.40,1:27:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在互联网之外给你留了线索？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a message outside the Internet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.89,1:27:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,老派间谍那套吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old-school spy stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.29,1:27:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以试着找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some nets I can cast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.79,1:27:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.00,1:27:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让组织瓦解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can work on tissue degeneration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.96,1:27:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得先把赵这套操作系统废掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you could fry whatever operational system Cho implanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.60,1:27:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.54,1:27:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.27,1:27:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得相信我 - 不怎么信呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to trust me. - Kind of don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.92,1:27:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的盟友 保护军方核弹密码那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ally, the guy protecting the military's nuclear codes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.04,1:27:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.20,1:27:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 班纳博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dr. Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.10,1:27:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创不是因为愤怒追杀的贾维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron didn't go after Jarvis because he was angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.03,1:27:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他攻击他是因为害怕他的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He attacked him because he was scared of what he can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.69,1:28:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以贾维斯潜伏了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Jarvis went underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.49,1:28:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,分散开 抛弃了他的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scattered, dumped his memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.49,1:28:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但基本的协议还没忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not his protocols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.52,1:28:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他拼起来 他才知道自己在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even know he was in there until I pieced him together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.34,1:28:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我帮你把贾维斯弄进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want me to help you put Jarvis into this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.84,1:28:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.64,1:28:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帮你把贾维斯弄进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna help you put Jarvis in this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.91,1:28:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的专业啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of my field, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.44,1:28:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最了解生物机能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know bio-organics better than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.80,1:28:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得贾维斯的程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just assume that Jarvis's operational matrix{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.95,1:28:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,能打败奥创的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can beat Ultron's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.53,1:28:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾维斯还没有意识 就能在内部打败奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jarvis has been beating him from inside without knowing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.88,1:28:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是机遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.00,1:28:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以造出完美的奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can create Ultron's perfect self{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.89,1:28:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会想着灭绝人类 还觉得是自己的优点\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the homicidal glitches he thinks are his winning personality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.44,1:28:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 必须这样 - 我觉得值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to. - I believe it's worth a go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.12,1:28:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进了死循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a loop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.24,1:28:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,又回到了从前 当初就是这里出的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm caught in a time loop. This is exactly where it all went wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.22,1:28:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道大家会怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know. I know what everyone's gonna say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.60,1:28:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们已经在说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're already saying it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.04,1:28:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是疯子科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're mad scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.86,1:29:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是怪物 哥们 得承认自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're monsters, buddy. We've gotta own it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.46,1:29:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,表明立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.04,1:29:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a loop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.84,1:29:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是走到了终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end of the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.23,1:29:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你能不能醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't sure you would wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.30,1:29:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能醒 想给你看点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hoped you would. I wanted to show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.04,1:29:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.93,1:29:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想陨石 多么纯粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a lot about meteors. The purity in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.30,1:29:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘣 就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom! The end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.27,1:29:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.70,1:29:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界焕然一新\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world made clean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.52,1:29:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,给新人类重建家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the new man to rebuild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.56,1:29:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注定是新人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was meant to be new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.52,1:30:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注定美妙无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was meant to be beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.70,1:30:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界本可以抬头望天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world would have looked to the sky{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.16,1:30:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and seen hope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.56,1:30:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到慈悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}seen mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.90,1:30:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在他们只会恐惧地抬头看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, they'll look up in horror{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.98,1:30:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只因为你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.72,1:30:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们伤害了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've wounded me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.80,1:30:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点不得不佩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you full marks for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.10,1:30:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是人类总是说 杀不死我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, like the man said, what doesn't kill me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.30,1:30:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会让我更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}just makes me stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.80,1:31:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这套框架不匹配\N{\fnArial\fs30}This framework is not compatible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.17,1:31:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因编码已经完成了97%\N{\fnArial\fs30}The genetic coding tower is at 97%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.08,1:31:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩三分钟 得赶紧把程序传上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to upload that schematic in the next three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.80,1:31:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只说一次 - 一次也不说怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna say this once. - How about "none-ce"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.13,1:31:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关掉 - 不行 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut it down! - Nope, not gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.38,1:31:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.50,1:31:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.18,1:31:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没进入你的意识吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not in your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.42,1:31:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.48,1:31:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,远不止是生气呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're way past that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.64,1:31:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用变绿都能掐死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could choke the life out of you and never change a shade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.44,1:31:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳 发生了这么多…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner, after everything that's happened…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.93,1:31:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,将要发生的事才最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing compared to what's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.32,1:31:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不知道里面有什么 - 这不是游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know what's in there. - This isn't a game!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.26,1:31:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.65,1:31:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.77,1:31:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pietro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.08,1:31:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.07,1:31:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没预见到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see that coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.88,1:31:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我换条线路上传\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm rerouting the upload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.58,1:32:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 惹我生气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, piss me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.22,1:32:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.96,1:33:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 刚真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry. That was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.20,1:33:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.96,1:33:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.25,1:33:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.11,1:34:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你帮忙创造了他吗？- 我看到了一个幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You helped create this? - I've had a vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.38,1:34:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有生命的希望都被个漩涡吸走 漩涡的中心就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whirlpool that sucks in all hope of life, and at its centre is that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.10,1:34:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？宝石吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? The gem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.13,1:34:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是意识宝石 六颗无限宝石之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Mind Stone. It's one of the six Infinity Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.96,1:34:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙里最强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest power in the universe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.39,1:34:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭能力无可比拟\N{\fnArial\fs30}unparalleled in its destructive capabilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.76,1:34:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你为什么还… - 因为斯塔克是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then why would you bring… - Because Stark is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.60,1:34:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可真是毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's definitely the end times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.98,1:34:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟赢不了奥创的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Avengers cannot defeat Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.59,1:34:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,光靠自己不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.45,1:34:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么幻视的声音像贾维斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does your Vision sound like Jarvis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.41,1:34:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们重构了贾维斯的程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}We reconfigured Jarvis's matrix{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.62,1:34:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造了新的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create something new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.55,1:34:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,新东西我真是看够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've had my fill of new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.44,1:34:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我是奥创的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm a child of Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.09,1:34:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.60,1:34:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.83,1:34:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是贾维斯 我是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not Jarvis. I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.15,1:34:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.36,1:34:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过你的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked in your head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.42,1:34:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了大灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and saw annihilation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.12,1:34:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.49,1:34:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她赞同顶个屁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her seal of approval means jack to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.65,1:34:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的力量 我们的恐惧 包括奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their powers, the horrors in our heads, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.72,1:34:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,都来自意识宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron himself, they all came from the Mind Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.12,1:34:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟宝石的力量比都不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're nothing compared to what it can unleash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.28,1:35:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可如果在我们这边… - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But with it on our side… - Is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.31,1:35:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.37,1:35:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们这边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On our side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.65,1:35:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's that simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.57,1:35:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好赶紧弄简单点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it better get real simple real soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.23,1:35:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在生命这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am on the side of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.62,1:35:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.60,1:35:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会毁灭生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will end it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.13,1:35:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在等什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.06,1:35:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You. - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.64,1:35:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,索克维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sokovia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.64,1:35:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜也关在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got Nat there, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.27,1:35:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们看错了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're wrong about you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.92,1:35:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是奥创造出来的怪物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're the monster that Ultron made you to be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.05,1:35:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.21,1:35:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想杀奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to kill Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.60,1:35:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很独特 很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's unique and he's in pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.56,1:35:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那痛苦会毁灭地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that pain will roll over the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.61,1:35:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以必须毁灭他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he must be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.60,1:35:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的每一个形态 留下的每一丝痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every form he's built, every trace of his presence on the net.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.35,1:35:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就得行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to act now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.41,1:36:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我们光靠自己是做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not one of us can do it without the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.99,1:36:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I am a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.48,1:36:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是自己也不会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I'd know if I were one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.08,1:36:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not what you are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.28,1:36:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是你们希望的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not what you intended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.20,1:36:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也许不会相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there may be no way to make you trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.71,1:36:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.07,1:36:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.76,1:36:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.02,1:36:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.72,1:36:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备妥当吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get what you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.20,1:37:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.29,1:37:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能都撑过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way we all get through this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.15,1:37:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕还有一个铁人在 我们都输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If even one tin soldier is left standing, we've lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.90,1:37:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会流血的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be blood on the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.17,1:37:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明晚是没安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no plans tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.80,1:37:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家伙先给我打\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get first crack at the big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.65,1:37:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他等的是钢铁侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron Man's the one he's waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.38,1:37:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他最恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true. He hates you the most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.99,1:37:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创知道我们要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron knows we're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.16,1:37:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很可能已经严阵以待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odds are we'll be riding into heavy fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.12,1:37:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早为这一刻做好了准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what we signed up for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.05,1:37:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但索克维亚的人民没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the people of Sokovia, they didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.70,1:37:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当务之急\N{\fnArial\fs30}So our priority{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.84,1:37:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是疏散他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}is getting them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.12,1:37:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭到袭击 全城市疏散 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under attack! Clear the city! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.00,1:37:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off your asses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.61,1:37:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只想过平静的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}All they want is to live their lives in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.48,1:37:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可今天不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not gonna happen today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.25,1:38:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们可以尽力保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can do our best to protect them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.81,1:38:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can get the job done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.36,1:38:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,查明奥创在造什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find out what Ultron's been building, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.92,1:38:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到罗曼诺夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}we find Romanoff, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.96,1:38:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫清战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we clear the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.44,1:38:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让平民卷入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the fight between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.89,1:38:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创觉得我们是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron thinks we're monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.59,1:38:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得我们才是世界的问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we're what's wrong with the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.20,1:38:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不仅仅是要打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't just about beating him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.04,1:38:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要看他说没说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about whether he's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.63,1:38:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.51,1:38:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.80,1:38:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.83,1:38:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.03,1:38:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.80,1:38:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙都在城里 要开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The team is in the city. It's about to light up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.73,1:38:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没找到钥匙什么的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you found a key lying around somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.13,1:38:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.77,1:39:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's our play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.07,1:39:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来护送你安全离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to get you to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.12,1:39:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 任务还没完成 - 我们可以帮忙疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Job's not finished. - We could help with the evacuation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.74,1:39:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有平民 我就不能参战\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't be in a fight near civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.75,1:39:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经付出了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've done plenty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.55,1:39:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的战争结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fight is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.48,1:39:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就直接消失吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we just disappear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.39,1:39:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.00,1:39:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在教堂 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man's in the church, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.72,1:39:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.66,1:39:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来忏悔罪过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to confess your sins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.97,1:39:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 你有多少时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. How much time you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.30,1:39:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正比你多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.00,1:39:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.31,1:39:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打药了吗？打了一针钒合金什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been juicing? Little vibranium cocktail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.20,1:39:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么… 我不想说「肿」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking… I don't wanna say "puffy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.50,1:39:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在拖延时间 保护平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stalling to protect the people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.67,1:39:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是任务 你忘了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is the mission. Did you forget?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.66,1:39:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早超越了你的任务 我是自由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've moved beyond your mission. I'm free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.96,1:40:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.89,1:40:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有你在拖延吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you were the only one stalling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.94,1:40:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的钒合金都在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the rest of the vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.81,1:40:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,功能不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Function, still unclear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.53,1:40:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的末日 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how you end, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.75,1:40:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个时代的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is peace in my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.17,1:40:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.52,1:40:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the bridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.29,1:40:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.44,1:40:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥创\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.60,1:40:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的幻视\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.16,1:40:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真从我这夺走了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They really did take everything from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.59,1:41:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己定的条款 可以自己改\N{\fnArial\fs30}You set the terms. You can change them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.83,1:41:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.11,1:41:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,周五 幻视呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friday, the Vision?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.48,1:41:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 他在把奥创和互联网隔离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss, it's working. He's burning Ultron out of the net.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.85,1:41:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他就逃不掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't escape through there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.95,1:41:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我封闭起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.86,1:41:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我在乎吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.12,1:41:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夺走我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take away my world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.31,1:41:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就夺走你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take away yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.66,1:42:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,周五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.60,1:42:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,索克维亚要飞起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sokovia is going for a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.23,1:42:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.46,1:42:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有多美？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the beauty of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.66,1:42:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种必然\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inevitability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.83,1:42:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,登到高处 却坠落下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rise, only to fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.79,1:43:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们 复仇者 就是我的陨石\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Avengers, you are my meteor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.68,1:43:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的利剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}My swift and terrible sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.52,1:43:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the earth will crack{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.50,1:43:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,会毁灭整个地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the weight of your failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.60,1:43:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我从电脑里清除 让幻视跟我反目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purge me from your computers, turn my own flesh against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.15,1:43:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.59,1:43:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,登到尘埃落定\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the dust settles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.37,1:43:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上仅存的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thing living in this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.32,1:43:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只剩下金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.36,1:43:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.04,1:43:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不变绿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna turn green?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.39,1:43:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情况我必须保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a compelling reason not to lose my cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.27,1:43:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I adore you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.18,1:43:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要另一个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need the other guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.04,1:43:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来完成任务吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's finish the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.51,1:44:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下算扯平了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really hope this makes us even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.24,1:44:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做英雄吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go be a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.76,1:44:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,钒合金做的核心有磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vibranium core's got a magnetic field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.29,1:44:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让城下的土地聚在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's keeping the rock together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.98,1:44:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果落下呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it drops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.63,1:44:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的话 死伤成千上万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, the impact will kill thousands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.52,1:44:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,高度足够的话 会毁灭全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once it gets high enough? Global extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.44,1:44:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼里还有人 十楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That building's not clear. The 10th floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.73,1:44:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.60,1:44:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 进浴缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Get in the tub!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.84,1:44:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空中单位 向桥的方向去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got airborne, heading up to the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.44,1:44:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 有东西过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap, you got incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.83,1:45:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming already came in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.10,1:45:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克 你想办法让城市安全降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark, you worry about bringing the city back down safely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.35,1:45:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的人就一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of us have one job, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.04,1:45:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}tear these things apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.88,1:45:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤了 就打伤他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get hurt, hurt them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.22,1:45:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.15,1:45:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住接着打\N{\fnArial\fs30}walk it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.04,1:45:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.25,1:45:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会造成了这一切？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I let this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.08,1:46:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 都是我们的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey, you okay? - This is all our fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.92,1:46:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 是你的错 是大家的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at me. It's your fault, it's everyone's fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.59,1:46:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.56,1:46:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能应付这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you up for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.08,1:46:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,能吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.75,1:46:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得弄明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I just need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.80,1:46:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为城市已经飞起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the city is flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.95,1:46:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 城市飞起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Look, the city is flying, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.96,1:46:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在对战机器大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're fighting an army of robots, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.76,1:46:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我只有弓箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have a bow and arrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.26,1:46:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切简直太扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this makes sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.57,1:46:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我准备回到战场 因为这是我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm going back out there because it's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.44,1:46:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没法边干工作边哄你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? And I can't do my job and babysit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.38,1:46:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做过什么 你之前是谁都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what you did or what you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.76,1:46:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去了就要战斗 毁掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you go out there, you fight, and you fight to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.05,1:46:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这也没事 我会叫你哥哥来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in here, you're good. I'll send your brother to come find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.02,1:46:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只要你踏出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you step out that door, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.47,1:46:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是复仇者的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are an Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.52,1:46:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 聊得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Good chat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.02,1:46:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 城市都飞起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the city is flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.05,1:47:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.70,1:47:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look at me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.17,1:47:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法救所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.72,1:47:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.45,1:47:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不可能」什么？话都不说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Never" what? You didn't finish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.64,1:47:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚在打盹吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, were you napping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.10,1:48:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.03,1:48:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是让我烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bothering me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.49,1:48:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.52,1:48:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这片安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're all clear here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.80,1:48:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这片还不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.17,1:48:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,差得远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are very not clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.36,1:48:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 朝你那儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, coming to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.31,1:49:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点走 老爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep up, old man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.18,1:49:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody would know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.32,1:49:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.40,1:49:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「最后见到他时 奥创坐在他身上」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The last I saw him, an Ultron was sitting on him."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.11,1:49:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,「是啊 会怀念他的 飞快的小混蛋」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Yeah, he'll be missed, that quick little bastard."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.57,1:49:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我已经想他了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I miss him already."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.03,1:49:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,先停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.99,1:49:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romanoff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.64,1:49:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.03,1:49:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,反重力装置设定好了 会反转\N{\fnArial\fs30}The anti-gravs are rigged to flip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.88,1:49:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰一下就会全力向下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch them, they'll go full reverse thrust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.04,1:49:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是飞速向下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city's not coming down slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.73,1:50:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,钒合金是核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spire is vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.12,1:50:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果托尔能打一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I get Thor to hit it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.32,1:50:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,装置会失效 但还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will crack. That's not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.99,1:50:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,后果仍然很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}The impact would still be devastating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.36,1:50:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果封住一端呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if we can cap the other end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.08,1:50:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把能量都逼回装置里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the atomic action doubling back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.90,1:50:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会让整座城市蒸发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could vaporise the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.97,1:50:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有城里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.96,1:50:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一波马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next wave is gonna hit any minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.64,1:50:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有进展没 斯塔克？- 没什么好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you got, Stark? - Huh? Nothing great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.39,1:50:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有个办法炸毁城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a way to blow up the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.73,1:50:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让城市撞击地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll keep it from impacting the surface, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.52,1:50:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你们得先撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you guys can get clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.61,1:50:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要解决方案 不是逃跑方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked for a solution, not an escape plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.91,1:50:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲击半径在不断增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impact radius is getting bigger every second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.73,1:50:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,得赶紧做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to make a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.95,1:50:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 这些人无处可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap, these people are going nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.28,1:50:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果斯塔克有法子毁了这… - 先带所有人撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If Stark finds a way to blow this rock… - Not till everyone's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.47,1:50:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是毁灭这里的人 还是毁灭所有地球人？这不用算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone up here versus everyone down there? There's no math there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.00,1:50:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有平民 我就不离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving this rock with one civilian on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.76,1:50:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say we should leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.88,1:50:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更惨的死法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's worse ways to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.61,1:50:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上哪儿看这样的美景呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else am I gonna get a view like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.83,1:51:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢美景真好 罗曼诺夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you like the view, Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.32,1:51:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,美的还在后头呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about to get better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.92,1:51:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.30,1:51:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从箱底翻出来的 还有几个老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled her out of mothballs with a couple of old friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.96,1:51:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有点灰 但还能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dusty, but she'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.96,1:51:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在才来 你个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fury, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.58,1:51:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴这么脏 怎么吻你妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! You kiss your mother with that mouth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.68,1:51:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,高度18000英尺 还在升高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altitude is 18, 000 and climbing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.48,1:51:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备部署救生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lifeboats secure to deploy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.99,1:51:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时三 二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disengage in three, two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.13,1:51:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.42,1:51:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是神盾局吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is S.H.I.E.L.D.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.28,1:52:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是神盾局该有的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what S.H.I.E.L.D. is supposed to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.40,1:52:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not so bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.08,1:52:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,带大家上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's load them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.91,1:52:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 右舷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we have multiple bogies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.52,1:52:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,纠集了数架敌机\N{\fnArial\fs30}converging on our starboard flank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.85,1:52:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们点颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show 'em what we got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.76,1:52:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.68,1:52:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.96,1:52:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回可有的讲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this is gonna be a good story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.30,1:52:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但你得先活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup. if you live to tell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.97,1:52:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我自己办不到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I can't hold my own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.72,1:52:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次成功了 我来握住你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get through this, I'll hold your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.44,1:52:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你嘴里就变了味\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to make it weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.92,1:52:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这群人之后还有50到100个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got about 50 to 100 more coming in after this group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.06,1:53:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Here we go. Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.99,1:53:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.48,1:53:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,六号舱已全部 锁定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number six boat is topped and locked…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.56,1:53:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,全员… 到头…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or stocked… Topped…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.39,1:53:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,人已经满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's full of people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.72,1:53:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌机来袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.68,1:53:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.31,1:53:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能救谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're saving anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.33,1:53:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我转一下 早一点让这座城掉下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turn that key and drop this rock a little early{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.30,1:53:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是会死伤上亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's still billions dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.20,1:53:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你也不能阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you can't stop that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.72,1:53:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是托尔 奥丁之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Thor, son of Odin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.17,1:53:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我还有一口气…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as long as there is life in my breast…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.57,1:53:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不出词了 准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am running out of things to say! Are you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.56,1:54:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这锤子重量分布得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's terribly well-balanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.16,1:54:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是锤头太重 挥起来会损失力量 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if there's too much weight, you lose power on the swing, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.68,1:54:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了 弄个热能护罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. Create a heat seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.76,1:54:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.88,1:54:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以在底下让装置过载\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could supercharge the spire from below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.44,1:54:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.60,1:54:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量够的话 热护罩可以成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}A heat seal could work with enough power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.76,1:54:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托尔 我有计划了 - 没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thor, I got a plan. - We're out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.96,1:54:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们冲着核心来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming for the core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.28,1:54:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德 送其他人上救生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodey, get the rest of the people on board that carrier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.24,1:54:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 复仇者 该搏回命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On it. - Avengers, time to work for a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.56,1:54:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧？- 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you good? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.28,1:54:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.48,1:54:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和班纳不是打算鸳鸯双飞 一起「隐居」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Banner better not be playing "hide the zucchini."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.96,1:54:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 铁头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, shellhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.44,1:54:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人不会飞呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us can fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.64,1:55:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么打算？- 这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the drill? - This is the drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.48,1:55:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让奥创碰到核心 我们就失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Ultron gets a hand on the core, we lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.24,1:55:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就这点能耐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the best you can do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.12,1:55:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,非得好心问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.80,1:55:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.24,1:55:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is exactly what I wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.24,1:55:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.68,1:55:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对阵所有的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}against all of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.60,1:55:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么可能阻止我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you possibly hope to stop me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.68,1:55:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爷子说过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, like the old man said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.99,1:55:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,齐心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.76,1:57:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我事后诸葛亮一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, with the benefit of hindsight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.44,1:57:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想逃离城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll try to leave the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.60,1:57:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以 一个也不能放 罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let them, not even one. Rhodey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.64,1:57:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.12,1:57:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没让你走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I didn't say you could leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.12,1:57:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争机器来了 就在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}War Machine coming at you! Right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.60,1:57:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.20,1:57:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,得撤了 我都能感觉到空气变稀薄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta move out. Even I can tell the air is getting thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.36,1:57:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去救生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys get to the boats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.80,1:57:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再找一下有没有漏的 一会找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sweep for stragglers. Be right behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.80,1:57:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 核心呢？- 我来保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the core? - I'll protect it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.04,1:57:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.32,1:57:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.76,1:57:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.16,1:57:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,带人们上救生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the people on the boats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.48,1:57:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能把你留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to leave you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.64,1:57:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能应付这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.00,1:57:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等大家都撤了再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back for me when everyone else is off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.48,1:58:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个也不能少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.10,1:58:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.76,1:58:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是比你大了12分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm 12 minutes older than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.84,1:58:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.48,1:58:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大 能量已经远低于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss, power levels are way below…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.12,1:58:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新分配能源 只有一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reroute everything. We get one shot at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.64,1:58:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道需要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I need to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.84,1:58:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dining room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.16,1:58:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东面的墙拆掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I knock out that east wall, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.08,1:58:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉就有了工作的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd make a nice workspace for Laura, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.20,1:58:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围挡一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up some baffling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.48,1:58:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她听不到孩子们乱跑的 怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't hear the kids running around. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.80,1:58:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你们总在厨房吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys always eat in the kitchen anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.04,1:58:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在餐厅吃饭啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one eats in a dining room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.24,1:58:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a lot of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.96,1:58:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧上救生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get your ass on a boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.68,1:58:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.80,1:58:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳就要下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun's getting real low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.08,1:59:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安全了 没事的 系好安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe now. You're gonna be okay. Buckle up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.28,1:59:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,保管好自己的物品 抓紧就坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure your gear, find a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.96,1:59:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,科斯特尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Costel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.32,1:59:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前一起在市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in the market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.36,1:59:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,科斯特尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Costel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.32,1:59:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔 我需要你回教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, I'm gonna need you back in the church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.48,1:59:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这些人了吗？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this the last of them? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.36,1:59:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他人都上航母了 - 如果这次成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone else is on the carrier. - You know, this works, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.24,1:59:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能活不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we maybe don't walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.36,1:59:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.60,1:59:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了束缚 我开心地玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no strings, so I have fun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.60,2:00:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不被任何人约束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not tied up to anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.88,2:00:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.64,2:00:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没预见到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see that coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.96,2:01:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.00,2:01:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泽林卡 - 科斯特尔 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zrinka! - Costel! Baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.24,2:02:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.40,2:02:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.24,2:02:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天真是漫长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.84,2:02:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.76,2:02:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在这会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stay here, you'll die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.60,2:02:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚死过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.76,2:02:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么感觉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how it felt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.60,2:02:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.96,2:03:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔 等我口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, on my mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.98,2:03:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.68,2:04:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家伙 我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, big guy. We did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.16,2:04:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The job is finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.04,2:04:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你得驾驶飞机返航？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I need you to turn this bird around, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.04,2:04:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐匿模式追踪不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't track you in stealth mode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.96,2:04:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我个忙 我需要你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So help me out. I need you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.76,2:05:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.76,2:05:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.52,2:05:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.40,2:05:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.44,2:05:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本该是最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to be the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.12,2:05:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克想造救世主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark asked for a saviour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.64,2:05:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,却甘心得到个奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and settled for a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.24,2:05:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们都让人失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose we are both disappointments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.12,2:05:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.08,2:05:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans are odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.08,2:05:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们觉得秩序与混乱是相对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think order and chaos are somehow opposites{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.48,2:05:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,想控制自己无力掌控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try to control what won't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.52,2:05:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们的努力值得尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is grace in their failings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.28,2:05:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没注意到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you missed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.88,2:05:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们注定灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.88,2:06:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.16,2:06:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事物的美 并不在能否长久\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a thing isn't beautiful because it lasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.16,2:06:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为他们的一员很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a privilege to be among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.40,2:06:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是天真到无可救药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're unbearably naive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.20,2:06:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.48,2:06:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我昨天才出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.16,2:07:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 来见见小娜阿姨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Say hi to Auntie Nat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.60,2:07:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖墩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.72,2:07:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个技术员标记了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our tech boys flagged this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.20,2:07:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在班达海坠毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splashed down in the Banda Sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.48,2:07:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是昆式战机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be the Quinjet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.36,2:07:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有斯塔克的隐匿技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with Stark's stealth tech, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.16,2:07:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本搜索不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}we still can't track the damn thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.28,2:07:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.08,2:07:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能跳机游到了斐济\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably jumped out and swam to Fiji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.60,2:07:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会寄明信片的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll send a postcard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.76,2:08:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「真希望你在这儿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wish you were here."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.44,2:08:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初是你派我招募的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me to recruit him way back when.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.16,2:08:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那时知道会发生什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know then what was gonna happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.32,2:08:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.44,2:08:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能先尽人事 再听天命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hope for the best, then make do with what you get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.44,2:08:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的团队不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a great team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.04,2:08:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么是永久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing lasts forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.28,2:08:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦永远在 罗曼诺夫小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble, Ms. Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.56,2:08:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管谁赢谁输 麻烦总是免不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter who wins or loses, trouble still comes around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.80,2:08:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则已经变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules have changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.20,2:08:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个新东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with something new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.96,2:08:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻视是人工智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the Vision is artificial intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.36,2:08:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一台机器 - 所以不算吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A machine. - So, it doesn't count?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.48,2:08:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,举锤子的不是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not like a person lifting the hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.56,2:08:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 到我们这就不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, different rules for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.44,2:08:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个好人 人造的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice guy. Artificial. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.68,2:08:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能举起锤子 就有资格留着意识宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can wield the hammer, he can keep the Mind Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.48,2:08:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石在幻视那儿很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safe with the Vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.80,2:08:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头安全可不好找\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these days, safe is in short supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.36,2:08:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是要是放在电梯里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you put the hammer in an elevator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.44,2:09:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 锤子会被举起来 - 电梯配不上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It would still go up. - Elevator's not worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.36,2:09:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会怀念你俩的贫嘴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna miss these little talks of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.32,2:09:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不走就不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you don't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.08,2:09:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.04,2:09:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,意识宝石是过去几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mind Stone is the fourth of the Infinity Stones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.32,2:09:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现的第四颗无限宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}to show up in the last few years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.84,2:09:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.24,2:09:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在下一盘大棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has been playing an intricate game{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.16,2:09:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们当棋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has made pawns of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.92,2:09:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果所有宝石都就位了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once all these pieces are in position…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.92,2:09:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个大同花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triple Yahtzee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.56,2:09:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能查明怎么回事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can find out what's coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.12,2:09:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.04,2:09:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides this one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.64,2:09:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有解释不了的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing that can't be explained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.32,2:09:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人真不懂得爱护草坪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man has no regard for lawn maintenance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.00,2:09:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是会怀念他的 你也会想我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna miss him, though. And you're gonna miss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.72,2:09:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,男子汉这回要掉不少泪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be a lot of manful tears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.48,2:09:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你的 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will miss you, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.36,2:09:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.52,2:09:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是该撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's time for me to tap out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.20,2:09:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许应该跟巴顿学点经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should take a page out of Barton's book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.52,2:09:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给小辣椒建个农场 希望没人去炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Build Pepper a farm, hope nobody blows it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.24,2:09:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}The simple life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.68,2:10:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会有那天的 - 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll get there one day. - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.20,2:10:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,成家 稳定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family, stability…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.76,2:10:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望那些的我75年前被冻进冰块里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy who wanted all that went in the ice 75 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.40,2:10:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来的是另一个我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think someone else came out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.80,2:10:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.96,2:10:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像回到家一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.32,2:10:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想盯着墙看还是想去工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna keep staring at the wall, or do you wanna go to work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.24,2:10:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那堵墙是挺有意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's a pretty interesting wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.76,2:10:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是和托尼深情对视呢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you and Tony were still gazing into each other's eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.84,2:10:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.12,2:10:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正算不上传奇队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not the '27 Yankees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.56,2:10:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是有几个大牌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got some hitters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.40,2:10:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不错 但还不是团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're good. They're not a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.96,2:10:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来调教一下他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's beat them into shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.08,2:11:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avengers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.44,2:13:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.32,2:13:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it myself.{\r}
